<rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/" version="2.0"><channel><title>彭博社 实时热点</title><link>https://feeds.bloomberg.com/markets/news.rss</link><description>彭博社 自动中文翻译源</description><docs>http://www.rssboard.org/rss-specification</docs><generator>python-feedgen</generator><lastBuildDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 14:40:03 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>纽约市私立学校将购买破产同行以前拥有的农场</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/nyc-private-school-to-buy-farm-previously-owned-by-bankrupt-peer</link><description>曼哈顿上西区的一所私立学校正计划购买卡茨基尔 (Catskills) 的一座 165 英亩的农场，该农场此前由破产的同行拥有。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/nyc-private-school-to-buy-farm-previously-owned-by-bankrupt-peer'&gt;纽约市私立学校将购买破产同行以前拥有的农场&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：NYC Private School to Buy Farm Previously Owned by Bankrupt Peer&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/nyc-private-school-to-buy-farm-previously-owned-by-bankrupt-peer</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 14:10:35 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>科技股下跌削弱风险偏好，国债上涨</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/treasuries-rise-across-curve-as-ai-concerns-dent-risk-sentiment</link><description>由于科技股再度下跌，削弱了投资者对风险资产的兴趣，美国国债周三全线上涨。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/treasuries-rise-across-curve-as-ai-concerns-dent-risk-sentiment'&gt;科技股下跌削弱风险偏好，国债上涨&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：US Treasuries Soar as Tech-Stock Losses Dent Risk Appetite&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/treasuries-rise-across-curve-as-ai-concerns-dent-risk-sentiment</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 06:49:34 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>丹格特炼油厂将于 12 月 1 日在拉各斯开始交易</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-25/dangote-refinery-set-to-start-trading-in-lagos-on-dec-1-video</link><description>一旦在拉各斯首次上市，丹格特石油炼油和石化 FZE 将成为非洲首次上市的最大公司。大亨阿利科·丹格特 (Aliko Dangote) 所拥有的公司通过首次公开募股估值约为 480 亿美元。彭博社记者 Jennifer Zabasajja 报道。 （来源：彭博社）&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-25/dangote-refinery-set-to-start-trading-in-lagos-on-dec-1-video'&gt;丹格特炼油厂将于 12 月 1 日在拉各斯开始交易&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Dangote Refinery Set to Start Trading in Lagos on Dec. 1&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-25/dangote-refinery-set-to-start-trading-in-lagos-on-dec-1-video</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 06:33:01 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>随着避险需求提振债券，科技股遭遇抛售：市场总结</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/asian-stocks-to-slide-as-ai-trade-doubts-resurface-markets-wrap</link><description>随着对人工智能行业前景的质疑不断增多，全球科技股的抛售没有显示出停止的迹象，投资者转向债券寻求安全。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/asian-stocks-to-slide-as-ai-trade-doubts-resurface-markets-wrap'&gt;随着避险需求提振债券，科技股遭遇抛售：市场总结&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Stocks Swoon as AI Fears Spur Rush to Treasuries: Markets Wrap&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/asian-stocks-to-slide-as-ai-trade-doubts-resurface-markets-wrap</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 22:09:18 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>Nvidia 仍面临市值损失 2 万亿美元的问题</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/nvidia-still-faces-issues-that-cost-2-trillion-in-market-value</link><description>随着投资者开始认真思考仍然笼罩在这家全球最大芯片制造商身上的问题，英伟达首席执行官黄仁勋周一回归后，围绕该公司股价的乐观情绪正在消退。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/nvidia-still-faces-issues-that-cost-2-trillion-in-market-value'&gt;Nvidia 仍面临市值损失 2 万亿美元的问题&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Nvidia Still Faces Issues That Cost $2 Trillion in Market Value&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/nvidia-still-faces-issues-that-cost-2-trillion-in-market-value</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 12:20:58 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>